# renv.lock is committed for reproducibility, but automatic renv activation is
# DISABLED so the pipeline scripts keep using the system R library (they render
# with rgl + magick and need the packages installed system-wide).
#
# To opt into the isolated renv library instead:
#   renv::restore()    # install the locked packages into renv/library
#   renv::activate()   # re-enable automatic activation (un-comments the line below)
#
# source("renv/activate.R")
